title: "Keep resize recovery attached to its original save"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Breaks RecoveryUsesRetainedFields or RetainedFieldIdentity
    lg1: Path to the RecoveryUsesRetainedFields or RetainedFieldIdentity bug
  }
  class lg0 breaks
  class lg1 bugPath
  s0: Before resize
  s1: Resize saved at time 1
  s2: Agent changed width to 500
  s3: Drag saved at time 2
  s4: Recoverable resize selected
  s5: Agent moved to 60,60
  s6: Recovery also reverted the newer position
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you resize to 300 by 50
  s1 --> s2: agent sets width to 500
  s2 --> s3: you drag to 40,40
  s3 --> s4: inspect retained fields and batch identity
  s4 --> s5: agent moves to 60,60
  s5 --> s6: reapply only the selected retained fields
